-duration: 4s;\">懐石</span>\n            \n            <div class=\"overflow-hidden mb-2\">\n                <span class=\"hero-reveal block text-xs md:text-sm tracking-[0.4em] uppercase text-[#C6A87C]\">Alsterhaus Hamburg</span>\n            </div>\n            \n            <div class=\"overflow-hidden mb-6\">\n                <h1 class=\"hero-reveal font-serif text-5xl md:text-7xl lg:text-8xl leading-[0.9] tracking-tight\">\n                    Die Kunst des<br>Wesentlichen\n                </h1>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"overflow-hidden\">\n                <p class=\"hero-reveal font-light text-white/80 max-w-md mx-auto text-sm leading-relaxed tracking-wide\">\n                    Authentische Kaiseki-Küche von Yoshizumi Nagaya. <br>Ein kulinarisches Erlebnis über den Dächern der Stadt.\n                </p>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"absolute bottom-10 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 text-white/50 flex flex-col items-center gap-4\">\n            <span class=\"text-[9px] tracking-[0.3em] uppercase writing-v-rl\">Entdecken</span>\n            <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:mouse-circle-linear\" class=\"text-2xl animate-bounce\"></iconify-icon>\n        </div>\n    </header>\n\n    <main>\n        <!-- Philosophy / Intro -->\n        <section id=\"philosophy\" class=\"py-32 px-6 md:px-12 max-w-[1400px] mx-auto\">\n            <div class=\"flex flex-col lg:flex-row gap-16 lg:gap-24 items-center\">\n                <div class=\"w-full lg:w-1/2 relative\">\n                    <div class=\"aspect-[4/5] bg-gray-100 overflow-hidden relative clip-reveal-trigger\">\n                        <img src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1615887023516-9dc779c46c82?q=80&w=1974&auto=format&fit=crop\" alt=\"Interior Details\" class=\"w-full h-full object-cover\">\n                        <div class=\"absolute bottom-0 left-0 w-full h-1/3 bg-gradient-to-t from-black/50 to-transparent\"></div>\n                        <div class=\"absolute bottom-6 left-6 text-white text-right\">\n                            <span class=\"font-jp text-3xl\">純粋</span>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                \n                <div class=\"w-full lg:w-1/2 space-y-10\">\n                    <div class=\"flex items-center gap-4\">\n                        <div class=\"h-[1px] w-12 bg-[#C6A87C]\"></div>\n                        <span class=\"text-xs font-bold tracking-[0.2em] text-[#C6A87C] uppercase\">Philosophie</span>\n                    </div>\n                    \n                    <h2 class=\"font-serif text-4xl md:text-6xl tracking-tighter text-[#111] leading-[1.1]\">\n                        Harmonie in <br>\n                        <span class=\"text-gray-400 italic font-light\">Perfektion.</span>\n                    </h2>\n\n                    <div class=\"space-y-6 text-[#444] font-light leading-relaxed\">\n                        <p>\n                            Im YOSHI zelebrieren wir die japanische Kaiseki-Tradition: Eine Abfolge von Speisen, die nicht nur den Gaumen, sondern alle Sinne berührt. \n                        </p>\n                        <p>\n                            Jedes Gericht ist eine Hommage an die Jahreszeit. Wir verzichten auf unnötige Effekte und konzentrieren uns auf das Produkt, die Textur und die Temperatur. Es ist die Suche nach dem reinen Geschmack.\n                        </p>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <div class=\"grid grid-cols-2 gap-8 pt-8 border-t border-gray-100\">\n                        <div>\n                            <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:chef-hat-heart-linear\" class=\"text-2xl mb-3 text-[#C6A87C]\"></iconify-icon>\n                            <h4 class=\"font-serif text-xl mb-1\">Meisterhandwerk</h4>\n                            <p class=\"text-xs text-gray-500 font-light\">Geführt von Yoshizumi Nagaya</p>\n                        </div>\n                        <div>\n                            <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:leaf-linear\" class=\"text-2xl mb-3 text-[#C6A87C]\"></iconify-icon>\n                            <h4 class=\"font-serif text-xl mb-1\">Saisonalität</h4>\n                            <p class=\"text-xs text-gray-500 font-light\">Täglich frische Zutaten</p>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n\n        <!-- Menu Grid -->\n        <section id=\"menu\" class=\"bg-white py-32 border-t border-gray-100 relative\">\n            <div class=\"max-w-[1400px] mx-auto px-6 md:px-12\">\n                <div class=\"flex justify-between items-end mb-20\">\n                    <div>\n                        <span class=\"text-xs font-bold tracking-[0.2em] text-[#C6A87C] uppercase block mb-3\">Kulinarik</span>\n                        <h2 class=\"font-serif text-4xl md:text-5xl tracking-tighter\">Speisekarte</h2>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"hidden md:block text-right\">\n                        <p class=\"text-xs text-gray-400 uppercase tracking-widest\">Öffnungszeiten</p>\n                        <p class=\"font-serif text-lg\">Mo - Sa 12:00 - 22:00</p>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <!-- Minimal Menu Layout -->\n                <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-x-12 gap-y-16\">\n                    \n                    <!-- Col 1: Lunch -->\n                    <div class=\"space-y-8\">\n                        <h3 class=\"font-serif text-2xl italic text-gray-400 border-b border-gray-100 pb-4\">Mittagstisch</h3>\n                        \n                        <div class=\"group cursor-pointer\">\n                            <div class=\"flex justify-between items-baseline mb-2\">\n                                <h4 class=\"text-base font-normal group-hover:text-[#C6A87C] transition-colors\">Sashimi Don</h4>\n                  