s\">Wagyu Tataki</h4>\n                                <span class=\"text-xs font-mono text-gray-400\">42€</span>\n                            </div>\n                            <p class=\"text-xs text-gray-500 leading-relaxed\">Kurz angebratenes Kagoshima Wagyu Beef A5 mit Ponzu.</p>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <!-- Col 3: Kaiseki -->\n                    <div class=\"space-y-8 bg-[#FAFAFA] -m-6 p-6 md:bg-transparent md:p-0 md:m-0\">\n                        <h3 class=\"font-serif text-2xl text-[#C6A87C] border-b border-[#C6A87C]/30 pb-4 flex items-center gap-2\">\n                            <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:star-linear\"></iconify-icon> Signature\n                        </h3>\n                        \n                        <div class=\"space-y-6\">\n                            <div>\n                                <h4 class=\"text-xl font-serif mb-2\">YOSHI Kaiseki</h4>\n                                <p class=\"text-sm text-gray-600 leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n                                    Eine 7- bis 9-gängige Reise durch die japanische Hochküche. Erleben Sie die Perfektion von Dashi, die Frische von Sashimi und die Kunst des Anrichtens.\n                                </p>\n                                <div class=\"flex gap-4 text-xs tracking-widest uppercase text-gray-400\">\n                                    <span>ab 145€ p.P.</span>\n                                    <span>Nur Abends</span>\n                                </div>\n                            </div>\n                            <button class=\"w-full py-3 border border-gray-200 hover:border-[#C6A87C] hover:text-[#C6A87C] transition-all text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.2em] mt-4 bg-white\">\n                                Menü Einsehen\n                            </button>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n\n        <!--